<section><div class="container"><p class="eyebrow">About · The humans behind the pixels</p><h1>You should not have to <em>manage your technology</em> between client calls.</h1>
<p style="max-width:760px">We are a team of 10–20 specialists based in Canada: designers, developers, cloud engineers, compliance specialists and recruiters. Design is one of our seven practices — not the whole company. No account managers passing messages — you talk to the people doing the work, from our first conversation to launch.</p>
